# Next.js surfaces

One app, **three products** via route groups (plus platform Admin):

| Group | Path | Product | Audience | Job |
|-------|------|---------|----------|-----|
| `(market)` | `/`, `/boards/*` | **Marketplace** | Public advertisers / agencies | Browse verified listings to place an outdoor ad |
| `(manage)` | `/manage/*` | **Manage CRM** | Media owners + office staff | Inventory, permits, contracts, publish to Market |
| `(field)` | `/field/*` | **Field PWA** | Tenant field agents | QR, proof of display, incidents, offline queue |
| `(admin)` | `/admin/*` | Super Admin | Platform staff | Tenants, flags, health |

## Hard rules

- Marketplace chrome must **not** primary-link Field or Admin (owner/field entry is secondary login only).
- Manage is the owner CRM — never treat Market as the owner workspace.
- Field technicians (`field_technician`) are redirected from `/manage` → `/field`.
- Post-login: honour `?next=`; else field roles → `/field`, everyone else → `/manage`.
- Market reads **publishable projection** only; never floor rates, costs, or client names.

## Patterns

- Prefer Server Components; Client Components only for maps, cameras, offline, interactive CRM
- Mutations: Server Actions or Route Handlers calling Supabase with user session
- Never import `admin.ts` into client components
- Status labels from config/enums — no free-text status compares in UI
- Board rows in Manage open Board 360 (`/manage/boards/[id]`); Market opens listing detail

## Field PWA

- `manifest` + large tap targets; installable standalone
- Camera + GPS stamp; queue uploads in IndexedDB when offline
- Bottom nav: Home · Scan · Queue only (no Market browse)

## Market specifics

- Availability date filter returns faces free for the **whole** range
- Cart may span owners; enquiry splits so owners never see each other’s rates (V2.0)
- Exact coordinates only for verified advertisers

## Performance budgets

Owner dashboard &lt; 2s · map interactive &lt; 3s · availability search &lt; 800ms
